{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE DEMO AVAILABLE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Arrows is a 2D puzzle game, where the rules are everchanging but only controls you'll have are the movement keys. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore grid-based maps, encountering both self-contained logic puzzles and exploration based treasure hunts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test things out, learn and study the environment to get the keys required to advance further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full release features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 levels, each with its own theme</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level comprised of several logic puzzles and movement challenges, each unique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trophies for completing everything in a level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only movement keys to control everything in the game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220720?t=1747241016","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3220720?t=1747241016","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220720/8ecd73ca77bad3b0d32b3aa7041e356f4defe591/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747241016","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220720/8ecd73ca77bad3b0d32b3aa7041e356f4defe591/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747241016","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3278110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FREE DEMO AVAILABLE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only Arrows is a 2D puzzle game, where the rules are everchanging